+<a id="toolspre-persist--waterfall"></a>
+
+#### `tools/pre-persist` — waterfall
+
+Project one complete model-requested call before any argument-bearing copy reaches the durable session log. `next()` keeps the original arguments; a listener may replace only the logged copy. Execution keeps the registry-owned original and independently enters `tools/pre-execute`. Scope-filtered dispatch (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-scope`): agent-scoped listeners receive only that agent's calls.
+
