+ * copy reaches the durable session log. `next()` keeps the original
+ * arguments; a listener may replace only the logged copy. Execution keeps
+ * the registry-owned original and independently enters `tools/pre-execute`.
+ * Scope-filtered dispatch (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-scope`): agent-scoped
+ * listeners receive only that agent's calls.
+ * @param call - complete parsed arguments plus their session position.
+ * @mode waterfall
+ */
+'tools/pre-persist'(this: Scoped<ToolRuntime>, call: ToolPersistenceCall, next: () => Promise<ToolPersistenceDecision>): Promise<ToolPersistenceDecision>
+```
+
